; A job that emits its candidates one at a time, thousands of times:
; every one is matched, in order once the job ends, while typing
; meanwhile keeps only the newest input's matches.
> (define t (start! (lambda () (completion:read "Item: " (list (completion:source (job one-at-a-time 5000))) h))))
> (define s (session))
> (type! "49")
> (wait-matches s)
> (length (texts s))
199
